### ⚠️ CRITICAL CONCEPTS

| Concept | What Frontend MUST Understand |
|---------|-------------------------------|
| **Upload ≠ Validation** | Uploading a model/dataset does NOT validate it immediately. Validation is a separate step. |
| **Async Operations** | Validations may take time. UI must handle long-running operations gracefully. |
| **File Formats** | Only specific model formats supported (.pkl, .h5, .pt, .onnx). Check before upload. |
| **Dataset Structure** | CSV must have specific columns for sensitive attributes (gender, race, age). |
| **Principle Independence** | Each ethical principle (fairness, transparency, privacy, accountability) is validated separately. |

