## 🔄 Validation Workflow

### Step-by-Step Process

#### Step 1: Create Project
```
Frontend Action: User clicks "New Project"
API Call: POST /api/v1/projects
Result: Project ID returned
```

#### Step 2: Upload Model
```
Frontend Action: User selects .pkl/.h5/.pt/.onnx file
API Call: POST /api/v1/models/upload
Required: project_id, model file
Result: Model ID returned + metadata extracted
```

#### Step 3: Upload Dataset
```
Frontend Action: User selects .csv file
API Call: POST /api/v1/datasets/upload
Required: project_id, CSV file with proper columns
Result: Dataset ID returned + column analysis
```

#### Step 4: Select Requirements
```
Frontend Action: User chooses template OR custom thresholds
Options:
  - Template: ETH1-Finance, ETH2-Healthcare, ETH3-Education
  - Custom: User defines metric thresholds
Result: Requirement configuration stored
```

#### Step 5: Run Validation
```
Frontend Action: User clicks "Validate Model"
API Call: POST /api/v1/validate
Required: model_id, dataset_id, requirement_id
Result: Validation run ID returned
Status: RUNNING → Monitor progress
```

#### Step 6: View Results
```
Frontend Action: Poll or WebSocket for completion
API Call: GET /api/v1/validations/{validation_id}
Result: Complete validation report with:
  - Fairness metrics (pass/fail)
  - Transparency charts
  - Privacy scores
  - Audit trail
```

