#### GET /api/v1/validations/{validation_id}/report
**Purpose:** Download full validation report (PDF)

**Request Headers:**
```http
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>
```

**Response (200 OK):**
- Content-Type: `application/pdf`
- Binary PDF file with complete report
- Filename: `validation_report_{validation_id}.pdf`

**Frontend Implementation:**
```javascript
const downloadReport = async (validationId) => {
  const response = await fetch(
    `/api/v1/validations/${validationId}/report`,
    {
      headers: {
        'Authorization': `Bearer ${accessToken}`
      }
    }
  );

  const blob = await response.blob();
  const url = window.URL.createObjectURL(blob);
  const a = document.createElement('a');
  a.href = url;
  a.download = `validation_report_${validationId}.pdf`;
  document.body.appendChild(a);
  a.click();
  window.URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
  document.body.removeChild(a);
};
